  <RimWorldAccess.Abilities.TargetKind.HumanlikePawn>personaje humanoide</RimWorldAccess.Abilities.TargetKind.HumanlikePawn>
  <RimWorldAccess.Abilities.TargetKind.Animal>animal</RimWorldAccess.Abilities.TargetKind.Animal>
