       label; other placeholders are inserted as their own fragments so that
       the sentence reads naturally even when some pieces are omitted. -->
  <RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Start.Fallback>Apuntado de habilidad</RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Start.Fallback>
  <RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Start.Header>Apuntando: {0}</RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Start.Header>
  <RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Start.TouchRange>. Rango de contacto</RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Start.TouchRange>
  <RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Start.Range>. Rango: {0} cuadros</RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Start.Range>
  <RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Start.AOE>, radio de área: {0} cuadros</RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Start.AOE>
  <RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Start.Psyfocus>. Psicofoco: {0}</RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Start.Psyfocus>
  <RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Start.NeuralHeat>, calor neural: {0}</RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Start.NeuralHeat>
  <RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Start.HintAoe>. Presiona R para comprobar la distancia y la línea de visión, T para ver los objetivos afectados.</RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Start.HintAoe>
  <RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Start.HintSingle>. Presiona R para comprobar la distancia y la línea de visión.</RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Start.HintSingle>

  <!-- Range/LOS/target feedback built by AbilityTargetingHelper.
       BuildRangeInfoAnnouncement. {0} = distance; {1} = max range.
       InRange/OutOfRange forms are dedicated so translators can reorder
       subject, distance, and verdict freely; NoTargetAtCursor takes the
       target-kind word as {0}. -->
