  <RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Range.Distance>Distancia: {0} cuadros</RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Range.Distance>
  <RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Range.InRange>, EN RANGO</RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Range.InRange>
