  <RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Range.InRangeTouch>, EN RANGO (contacto)</RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Range.InRangeTouch>
  <RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Range.MustBeAdjacent>, debe estar adyacente (rango de contacto)</RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Range.MustBeAdjacent>
  <RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Range.NoLineOfSight>, SIN LÍNEA DE VISIÓN</RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Range.NoLineOfSight>
