  <RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Affected.CountPrefix>Afectados: {0} - {1}</RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Affected.CountPrefix>
  <RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Affected.AndMore>, y {0} más</RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Affected.AndMore>

